## SC8: Pass 3 — AutocompleteOverlay + Items Build [G-04, G-05, G-09]

### Files
# app/components/features/search/AutocompleteOverlay.tsx
# app/components/features/search/AutocompleteItem.tsx
# app/components/layout/header/SearchField.tsx (integration)

### Target State
# Debounced autocomplete dropdown below search field.
# Max 6 product suggestions with thumbnails (desktop), without (mobile).
# Keyboard navigation (arrow keys, Enter, Escape).
# "View all results" footer link.

### Data Flow
# SearchField manages:
#   - query state (useState)
#   - isOverlayOpen state (useState)
#   - autocompleteResults state (useState)
#   - activeIndex state (useState, -1 = none)
#   - Debounced fetch: 300ms after last keystroke, call searchProductsAutocomplete(query)
#   - Race condition guard: AbortController or check query matches
# SearchField renders AutocompleteOverlay when isOverlayOpen && results.length > 0

### AutocompleteOverlay Design Tokens
# Container: bg-surface-elevated, border border-border-secondary, rounded-lg, shadow-cardDark
# Section label: type-overline text-accent-500 — "Products"
# Item: p-3, flex items-center gap-3
# Item hover: bg-surface-card rounded-md (transition-colors duration-150)
# Item active (keyboard): bg-surface-card border-l-2 border-brand-400
# Thumbnail (desktop only): w-12 h-12, rounded-md, bg-surface-productImage
# Product name: type-body text-primary
# Product meta: type-caption text-secondary — "Brand · $Price"
# Footer: type-caption text-brand-400 hover:underline, p-3, border-t border-border-secondary

### DoD (Layer 2 → 3 → 4, Desktop → Mobile)
