# - [ ] L2 Desktop: AutocompleteItem has flex row with thumbnail + text stack
# - [ ] L2 Desktop: Footer link at bottom
# - [ ] L2 Mobile: Full-width overlay below expanded search header, no thumbnails
# - [ ] L3 Desktop: bg-surface-elevated, shadow-cardDark, rounded-lg, all tokens applied
# - [ ] L3 Desktop: Thumbnail with bg-surface-productImage, object-contain, mix-blend-multiply
# - [ ] L3 Desktop: "Products" label as type-overline text-accent-500
# - [ ] L3 Mobile: Same surface tokens, border-b dividers between items
# - [ ] L4 Desktop: Hover bg on items (transition-colors duration-150)
# - [ ] L4 Desktop: Active suggestion highlight (border-l-2 border-brand-400)
# - [ ] L4 Desktop: Overlay open animation (opacity + translateY, duration-200)
# - [ ] L4: Keyboard — ArrowDown/ArrowUp moves activeIndex through items
# - [ ] L4: Keyboard — Enter on item navigates to /product/[slug]
