# RWD STRATEGY
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# | Breakpoint     | Search Field          | Autocomplete         | Results Grid |
# |----------------|-----------------------|----------------------|--------------|
# | base (0px)     | Icon only in header   | Full-width, no imgs  | 1 column     |
# | xs (475px)     | Icon only             | Full-width, no imgs  | 2 columns    |
# | sm (640px)     | Visible input field   | Aligned to input     | 2 columns    |
# | md (768px)     | Visible, max-w-sm     | With thumbnails      | 3 columns    |
# | lg-touch       | Visible, max-w-md     | With thumbnails      | 3 columns    |
# | lg-desktop     | Visible, max-w-xl     | With thumbnails      | 4 columns    |

